# Requirement schema (supporting file for the solotrace-audit skill)

Paste this as a quick-reference when reviewing extracted requirements.

```json
{
  "id": "REQ-01",
  "title": "Short title",
  "text": "Full requirement text from the specification.",
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "System must reject deposits of 0 or less.",
    "System must reject deposits greater than 50000.00."
  ],
  "risk": "High",
  "change": "none"
}
```

**Rules:**
- `id` must match `^REQ-\d{2}$`
- `risk` ∈ `{High, Medium, Low}`
- `change` ∈ `{none, changed, new}`
- `acceptance_criteria` must have at least one entry
